<Shell title="Aero · External benchmarks" description="Versioned comparisons against independent experiments, with public chronology and retained outcomes." path="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/"><header><p class="eyebrow">AERO / EXTERNAL BENCHMARK REGISTER</p><h1>Independent measurements. Preserved outcomes.</h1><p>External validation complements verification; it does not replace it. Incomplete challenges remain visibly incomplete.</p></header><article><p class="eyebrow">CFD / CHALLENGE 01</p><span class="status pending">NOT EVALUATED</span><h2>Blind Validation Challenge 01</h2><p>NASA TM-4074 Table XIII inputs and encrypted references are frozen. Actual solver isolation and a fresh input-only model review are complete. Numerical specification remains on hold; no experimental acceptance result exists.</p><a href="/software/aero/evidence/benchmarks/blind-validation-01/">Read the protocol and current chronology →</a></article><section><h2>Register policy</h2><p>Each future CFD, thermal or structural benchmark receives its own versioned entry, source citation, preregistration, frozen prediction and comparison history. Failed completed challenges remain listed. There are no placeholder result cards.</p><a href="/software/aero/evidence/">Return to all evidence →</a></section></Shell>
